# Docker builds (GCP amd64 local; cluster arm64 via buildkit)

## Hard rules

1. **Never** `docker build`, `docker compose build`, `cargo build` for container images, or `scp` source to compile on **GCP legacy VMs** (`c-personal` / `35.212.234.193`). Runtime only: `docker pull`, `docker run`, firewall, tailscale.
2. **btm OKE (arm64)** — cluster images via **buildkit** only. See `cluster-buildkit.mdc`. No local `docker build` for arm64 releases.
3. **GCP static egress** (`c35-static-egress`) — **`linux/amd64` only**, built **locally** with buildx, pushed to OCIR, then pulled on GCP.

## GCP static egress (amd64)

```powershell
.\_\scripts\deploy\publish_gcp_static_egress.ps1
```

Image: `hsg.ocir.io/axr8wqrrukgm/c35-static-egress:latest` (CONNECT proxy; same crate as `c35-proxy-cf-warp`, no WARP sidecar on GCP).

Runbook: [`_/deployments/gcp-static-egress/README.md`](../../_/deployments/gcp-static-egress/README.md)

## Summary

| Artifact | Platform | Build |
|----------|----------|--------|
